<title>HONG KONG: Melco Int'l says 1996 net up 28.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Melco Int'l says 1996 net up 28.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   47.8   vs  38.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    18.0   vs  18.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    57.03  vs  44.36</p>
<p>    Turnover		     277.39 vs  256.03</p>
<p>    Company name		 Melco International Development Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 14-20</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   May 27</p>
<p>NOTE - Melco is a property investment company.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 22.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 4.5 cents) vs 21 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
